CM_ "HS-CAN 500 kbit/s, 2005 F-350 6.0L PCM side (translator CAN0 input), OBD pins 6/14. Decoded from the 2026-10-24 KOEO, 2026-10-25 parked sync and 2026-10-25 drive captures (listen-only USB2CAN-X2; ground jumper never confirmed) with FORScan logging alongside, plus the CANBed V1.2 translator code. 14 broadcast IDs: 105 106 200 201 212 215 217 225 230 420 430 440 4D0 4FF (no 0x151 on this truck). FORScan diagnostics on 7E0/7E8 (PCM) and 7E1/7E9 (TCM) are not broadcast and not in this file; the confirmed DID formulas are in tools/signal-finder/sigfind/pid_table.py. The cluster/PATS/APCM live on SCP (J1850 PWM, pins 2/10), not here.";
CM_ BO_ 261 "[conf=low] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN KOEO capture 2026-10-24 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-24_keyon_noengine_can0.log)] Periodic 16 ms. b0-1 and b2-3 always identical. b5 bit5 = Park.";
CM_ SG_ 261 Unknown_B0_1 "[conf=low] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN KOEO capture 2026-10-24 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-24_keyon_noengine_can0.log)] KOEO 69; idle ~550-716; crank peak 1607. Drive: R2 0.93 vs RPM, 0.90 vs VSS/OSS (k 0.77 rpm/count, +432), so speed/torque related but not a clean copy of anything logged. Unknown.";
CM_ SG_ 261 Unknown_B2_3 "[conf=medium] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN KOEO capture 2026-10-24 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-24_keyon_noengine_can0.log)] Always equal to b0-1 in all captures.";
CM_ SG_ 261 Unknown_B4 "[conf=low] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN KOEO capture 2026-10-24 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-24_keyon_noengine_can0.log)] C8 parked/cold; 76-200 on the drive (weak R2 0.34 vs EOT). Unknown.";
CM_ SG_ 261 ParkFlag_B5 "[conf=medium] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN KOEO capture 2026-10-24 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-24_keyon_noengine_can0.log)] 0x27 in Park (all of the sync capture; drive from 1180-1188 s and from 1207 s to the end, matching 0x230 b0 = F0 / 0x420 b3 = 40), 0x07 otherwise. Bit 5 = Park.";
CM_ SG_ 261 Const_B6 "[conf=medium] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN KOEO capture 2026-10-24 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-24_keyon_noengine_can0.log)] Constant 0x6C.";
CM_ SG_ 261 Unknown_B7 "[conf=low] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN KOEO capture 2026-10-24 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-24_keyon_noengine_can0.log)] 80 in Park (sync), 86 while driving, 82/84 briefly around P/R/D changes. PRNDL-related; unconfirmed.";
CM_ BO_ 262 "[conf=medium] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs)] Periodic 16 ms. b7 = engine load (PID 04); status bytes change at crank/run, with pedal and TCC/decel state.";
CM_ SG_ 262 EngineState_B0 "[conf=low] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs)] 0x62 key-on engine-off; 0x42 from crank (VPWR dip); 0x04 -> 0x03 -> 0x02 when the engine caught. 02-04 on the drive. One crank event only.";
CM_ SG_ 262 Unknown_B1 "[conf=low] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs)] Busy while running. Unknown.";
CM_ SG_ 262 Unknown_B2 "[conf=low] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs)] 01/02 with bit5 (0x20) set in some coast-down/stop stretches and through most of the parked idle (1218-1427 s). Unknown.";
CM_ SG_ 262 Unknown_B3 "[conf=low] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs)] 0 KOEO; 0x8D-0x94 most of the time running. Unknown.";
CM_ SG_ 262 PedalDecelState_B4 "[conf=low] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs)] Sync: 01 idle, 02 during blips. Drive (VSS>30): 01 in 149/163 samples with TCC slip and mostly APP=0; 02/03 with APP>0 and TCC locked (1291/1292). Pedal and TCC state are confounded here (TCC unlocks on closed pedal), so the meaning is not settled.";
CM_ SG_ 262 Unknown_B5 "[conf=low] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs)] Busy while running. Unknown.";
CM_ SG_ 262 Unknown_B6 "[conf=medium] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs)] Always 0.";
CM_ SG_ 262 EngineLoad "[conf=high] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs)] Engine load = raw x 100/255 %. Same raw as PCM DID 0x0004 in 1560/1753 replies (rest within +-3, timing), R2 0.9999 vs DID and 0.9961 vs FORScan LOAD.OBDII over 0-81 %. (Sync: 0 KOEO, ~90 % at cold idle and lower in free-revs, consistent with OBD load at idle.)";
CM_ BO_ 512 "[conf=high] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs); translator code (CANBed V1.2 dump)] Periodic 8 ms. b7 = boost (translator -> cluster 0x407). b0/b2/b4 are idle/decel/TCC-related state bytes.";
CM_ SG_ 512 DecelState_B0 "[conf=low] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs); translator code (CANBed V1.2 dump)] Sync: 03 for ~90 ms at start, 01 at blip ends. Drive (VSS>30): 01 in 140/142 samples where TCC was slipping with APP mostly 0; 02/03 with TCC locked. Same confounding as 0x106 b4.";
CM_ SG_ 512 Unknown_B1 "[conf=low] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs); translator code (CANBed V1.2 dump)] 0 KOEO; busy running. Unknown.";
CM_ SG_ 512 IdleState_B2 "[conf=low] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs); translator code (CANBed V1.2 dump)] 01 KOEO and almost always while driving; 04 at idle; 03 in transitions/coast-downs.";
CM_ SG_ 512 Unknown_B3 "[conf=low] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs); translator code (CANBed V1.2 dump)] 157 KOEO; busy while running. Unknown.";
CM_ SG_ 512 OffIdle_B4 "[conf=low] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs); translator code (CANBed V1.2 dump)] Sync: 04 while RPM was above idle in blips. Drive (VSS>30): 04 in 1259/1321 TCC-locked samples, 03 mostly with TCC slip and APP=0.";
CM_ SG_ 512 Unknown_B5 "[conf=low] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs); translator code (CANBed V1.2 dump)] Busy while running. Unknown.";
CM_ SG_ 512 Unknown_B6 "[conf=medium] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs); translator code (CANBed V1.2 dump)] Always 0.";
CM_ SG_ 512 BoostInput "[conf=high] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs); translator code (CANBed V1.2 dump)] Boost, 1 kPa/count above ~93 kPa. Drive: MAP(DID 0x1440) = 1.006*b7 + 92.7 kPa, R2 0.9947 (n=1751, b7 0-96, MAP to 192 kPa); sync: 1.04*b7 + 94.0 (R2 0.965, small range). b7 = 0 when MAP is below ~92 kPa (MAP 87-92 at closed pedal). Not proven whether zero tracks baro or is a fixed ~93 kPa: baro was not logged and both runs were near the same altitude. Translator maps 0..254 -> cluster 0x407 256..735. Bo: boost.";
CM_ BO_ 513 "[conf=high] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs); translator code (CANBed V1.2 dump)] Periodic 8 ms. Engine speed, vehicle speed and accelerator pedal (all matched to PCM DIDs), plus an engine-acceleration value.";
CM_ SG_ 513 Flag_B0_7 "[conf=low] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs); translator code (CANBed V1.2 dump)] b0 bit7. Sync: set 100.47-101.66 s during the crank. Drive: set 5 times for 0.5-7 s during closed-pedal coast-downs (APP 0, VSS 0-65 km/h, RPM ~680-870). Not simply a crank flag: maybe fuel cut / engine-not-driving. Unknown.";
CM_ SG_ 513 EngineSpeed "[conf=high] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs); translator code (CANBed V1.2 dump)] b0 low nibble + b1, 12-bit BE, 1 rpm/count. vs PCM DID 0x1165/4: sync R2 0.99998 (0-2137 rpm), drive R2 1.0000 (631-2343 rpm). b0.7 is a separate flag, so do not read b0-1 as 16 bits. Translator used b0-1 x ~1.009.";
CM_ SG_ 513 EngineAccel "[conf=low] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs); translator code (CANBed V1.2 dump)] b2-3 BE minus 0x4000. 0x3FFF KOEO; ~0 at steady idle; tracks smoothed d(RPM)/dt in the sync capture (R2 0.87, ~0.95 rpm/s per count). Scale approximate.";
CM_ SG_ 513 VehicleSpeed "[conf=high] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs); translator code (CANBed V1.2 dump)] b4-5 BE x 0.01 km/h. vs PCM DID 0x11C1 (1/512 mph) and FORScan VSS: R2 1.0000, factor exactly 0.01, 0-139.5 km/h (drive). Translator scaled it by 0.00984 into the cluster 0.01 km/h field (~1.6 % low).";
CM_ SG_ 513 AccelPedalPosition "[conf=high] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs); translator code (CANBed V1.2 dump)] Accelerator pedal = same raw as PCM DID 0x09D4 (1715/1752 replies identical, rest +-1-2, timing), i.e. raw x 100/256 %. R2 0.9983 vs FORScan APP (0-31 %, highway driving only; full pedal not seen). Sync: leads RPM by ~1.9 s in free-revs, as a pedal should.";
CM_ SG_ 513 Unknown_B7 "[conf=low] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs); translator code (CANBed V1.2 dump)] ~0x80; 0x72-0x8F on the drive. Possibly signed around 0x80. Unknown.";
CM_ BO_ 530 "[conf=low] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN KOEO capture 2026-10-24 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-24_keyon_noengine_can0.log)] Periodic 24 ms. Constant 00 00 FF FE 00 00 00 00 in all captures, parked and driving.";
CM_ SG_ 530 PCM05_212_Data "[conf=low] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN KOEO capture 2026-10-24 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-24_keyon_noengine_can0.log)] Undecoded payload, big-endian integer of all bytes.";
CM_ BO_ 533 "[conf=medium] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs)] Periodic 24 ms. Three speed fields (wheel speeds?). b7 = 0x40 just after the engine started (sync).";
CM_ SG_ 533 WheelSpeedA "[conf=medium] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs)] Speed-like: (raw - 10106) x 0.01 km/h. Drive: R2 0.9999 vs VSS for each field (fit 0.0101/-101.5); 10106 (0x277A) when stopped and never below it, reverse reads positive (up to 10804), so no direction sign. The three fields differ by up to ~+-0.5 km/h (1-99 %ile), as wheel speeds would in turns. Possibly three wheel/axle speeds (which wheel is which unknown).";
CM_ SG_ 533 WheelSpeedB "[conf=medium] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs)] Speed-like: (raw - 10106) x 0.01 km/h. Drive: R2 0.9999 vs VSS for each field (fit 0.0101/-101.5); 10106 (0x277A) when stopped and never below it, reverse reads positive (up to 10804), so no direction sign. The three fields differ by up to ~+-0.5 km/h (1-99 %ile), as wheel speeds would in turns. Possibly three wheel/axle speeds (which wheel is which unknown).";
CM_ SG_ 533 WheelSpeedC "[conf=medium] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs)] Speed-like: (raw - 10106) x 0.01 km/h. Drive: R2 0.9999 vs VSS for each field (fit 0.0101/-101.5); 10106 (0x277A) when stopped and never below it, reverse reads positive (up to 10804), so no direction sign. The three fields differ by up to ~+-0.5 km/h (1-99 %ile), as wheel speeds would in turns. Possibly three wheel/axle speeds (which wheel is which unknown).";
CM_ SG_ 533 Unknown_B6_7 "[conf=low] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs)] 0 except b7 0x40 briefly after start.";
CM_ BO_ 535 "[conf=low] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN KOEO capture 2026-10-24 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-24_keyon_noengine_can0.log)] Periodic 24 ms. Only b0 moves.";
CM_ SG_ 535 Unknown_B0 "[conf=low] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN KOEO capture 2026-10-24 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-24_keyon_noengine_can0.log)] 0 parked/cold; 0-0x19 on the drive, non-zero 17 % of the time, mostly while the torque converter was slipping (TCC ratio > 1.01) and at low speed. TCC slip related candidate; no linear fit to slip rpm (R2 0.03).";
CM_ SG_ 535 Const_B1_7 "[conf=medium] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN KOEO capture 2026-10-24 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-24_keyon_noengine_can0.log)] Always 0.";
CM_ BO_ 549 "[conf=high] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs); translator code (CANBed V1.2 dump)] Periodic 8 ms. b0 tow/haul, b2-3 second RPM, b4-5 output shaft speed, b7 trans fluid temp.";
CM_ SG_ 549 TowHaul_B0 "[conf=medium] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs); translator code (CANBed V1.2 dump)] 0x60 for 338.4-588.3 s only, matching the passenger-called tow/haul on/off at 341.3 / 594.4 s (12:22:02 / 12:26:15 PDT) within the few-second call latency. One on/off cycle.";
CM_ SG_ 549 Const_B1 "[conf=medium] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs); translator code (CANBed V1.2 dump)] Constant 0xFF.";
CM_ SG_ 549 EngineSpeed2 "[conf=medium] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs); translator code (CANBed V1.2 dump)] RPM-like (sync R2 0.997 vs DID 0x1165, ~40 rpm below 0x201 at idle). Use 0x201 for RPM.";
CM_ SG_ 549 OutputShaftSpeed "[conf=high] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs); translator code (CANBed V1.2 dump)] Transmission output shaft speed, 1 rpm/count. vs TCM DID 0x11B5/4 and FORScan OSS: R2 1.0000, factor 1, offset 0 (0-3199 rpm). 0 in the parked sync capture.";
CM_ SG_ 549 Const_B6 "[conf=medium] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs); translator code (CANBed V1.2 dump)] Always 0.";
CM_ SG_ 549 TransFluidTemp "[conf=medium] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs); translator code (CANBed V1.2 dump)] TFT degC + 40, integer. Drive: b7-40 = 71/72/73 vs TCM DID 0x1674 (1/8 degF) 71.2-71.8 / 71.8-72.9 / 72.9-73.9 degC, a clean monotone state match, but only 3 values (weak). Sync: 61 cold = 21 degC, near ambient. BUT the sync free-revs showed jumps to 88/108 that decay in 2-3 s, which a fluid temperature cannot do; not seen on the drive. Translator feeds it to the cluster trans temp gauge.";
CM_ BO_ 560 "[conf=high] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN KOEO capture 2026-10-24 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-24_keyon_noengine_can0.log)] Periodic 32 ms. Transmission (5R110W): gear code and commanded gear ratio.";
CM_ SG_ 560 GearCode "[conf=high] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN KOEO capture 2026-10-24 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-24_keyon_noengine_can0.log)] Low nibble = TCM gear code (same codes as TCM DID 0x11B3/2 and FORScan GEAR: 1503/1503 state matches for codes 1/2/3/5/6; code 4 never seen on either). 0x10 = reverse (FORScan GEAR_INPT=Reverse in 631/652 samples), 0xF0 = Park/Neutral (all of the parked sync capture), 0xF1 transitional. Codes 5/6 are physical 4th/5th by ratio (b1-2: 1.00 / 0.71; locked RPM/OSS in code 6 = 0.712).";
CM_ SG_ 560 GearRatio "[conf=high] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN KOEO capture 2026-10-24 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-24_keyon_noengine_can0.log)] b1 bit0 + b2 BE x 0.01 = gear ratio of the current gear: code 1 -> 0x0137 = 3.11, 2 -> 2.21, 3 -> 1.54, 5 -> 0.99, 6 -> 0.71 (5R110W published 3.11/2.22/1.55/1.00/0.71). Park shows 0x018F (3.99, placeholder?). Values in between during shifts. Defined as 9 bits (b1 bit0 + b2) because b1 was only ever 00/01; widen it if b1 bits 1-7 ever move.";
CM_ SG_ 560 Const_B3_7 "[conf=medium] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN KOEO capture 2026-10-24 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-24_keyon_noengine_can0.log)] Always 0.";
CM_ BO_ 1056 "[conf=high] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN KOEO capture 2026-10-24 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-24_keyon_noengine_can0.log); translator code (CANBed V1.2 dump)] Periodic ~96 ms. b0 ECT, b1 distance counter, b2 fuel counter, b3 PRNDL, b4 = 0x40.";
CM_ SG_ 1056 EngineCoolantTemp "[conf=high] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN KOEO capture 2026-10-24 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-24_keyon_noengine_can0.log); translator code (CANBed V1.2 dump)] degC + 40. Sync (cold): R2 0.995 vs FORScan ECT, endpoints exact vs PCM DID 0x1139 over 19-39 degC. Drive: 91-95 degC hot (ECT not polled on the drive, so the hot end has no direct reference; plausible thermostat range, EOT 79-89 degC at the same time). Translator sends raw+16 to cluster 0x156 b0.";
CM_ SG_ 1056 DistanceCounter "[conf=high] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN KOEO capture 2026-10-24 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-24_keyon_noengine_can0.log); translator code (CANBed V1.2 dump)] Rolling 8-bit counter of distance: 0.2 m/count (5000 counts/km). Drive: 10-s count rate vs VSS R2 1.000, 1.3856 counts/s per km/h; 224311 counts over 44.95 km by integrating 0x201 speed = 0.2004 m/count. Constant 0 while parked (sync). Cluster odometer/trip feed candidate.";
CM_ SG_ 1056 FuelCounter "[conf=medium] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN KOEO capture 2026-10-24 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-24_keyon_noengine_can0.log); translator code (CANBed V1.2 dump)] Rolling 8-bit counter while running (0 KOEO): ~6 counts/s hot idle, ~46/s at highway speed. 10-s rate vs RPM x LOAD (fuel-flow proxy) R2 0.994. Probably fuel used for the cluster MPG/DTE; volume per count unknown (no fuel-rate PID).";
CM_ SG_ 1056 Prndl_B3 "[conf=medium] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN KOEO capture 2026-10-24 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-24_keyon_noengine_can0.log); translator code (CANBed V1.2 dump)] 0x40 parked (sync, end of drive), 0x10 driving, 0x01 while 0x230 b0 = 0x10 (reverse), 0x80 for ~0.3 s between them. Selector/PRNDL state.";
CM_ SG_ 1056 StatusB4 "[conf=medium] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN KOEO capture 2026-10-24 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-24_keyon_noengine_can0.log); translator code (CANBed V1.2 dump)] Constant 0x40 in every capture. When != 0x40 the translator sends cluster 0x420 = 00 00 00 00 00 00 73 FF. Meaning of other values unknown.";
CM_ SG_ 1056 Unknown_B5 "[conf=low] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN KOEO capture 2026-10-24 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-24_keyon_noengine_can0.log); translator code (CANBed V1.2 dump)] 0 parked; toggles 00/40 roughly every 2.3 s / 10 s on the drive. Unknown.";
CM_ SG_ 1056 Const_B6 "[conf=medium] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN KOEO capture 2026-10-24 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-24_keyon_noengine_can0.log); translator code (CANBed V1.2 dump)] Always 0.";
CM_ SG_ 1056 Unknown_B7 "[conf=low] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN KOEO capture 2026-10-24 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-24_keyon_noengine_can0.log); translator code (CANBed V1.2 dump)] 0xFF in the parked sync capture, 0x07 for the whole drive. Unknown.";
CM_ BO_ 1072 "[conf=low] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs)] Periodic 30 ms. b0 fuel-level candidate, b1 unknown, b6.7 crank flag.";
CM_ SG_ 1072 FuelLevelCandidate_B0 "[conf=low] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs)] 0x42 (66) constant in the parked sync capture; on the drive falls smoothly 214 -> 175 over ~30 min / 45 km (200-s medians 214,210,204,200,195,192,190,189,176,175). Fits a fuel level (~15 % of range for ~45 km), but the sync value is very different (other tank? different fill?). No fuel-level PID was logged.";
CM_ SG_ 1072 Unknown_B1 "[conf=low] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs)] NOT battery voltage (sync: R2 0.39 vs VPWR; flat while VPWR fell 2 V at crank; jumped 90 -> 107 when the engine fired). Drive: 73-255, median ~172-180 with no relation to RPM (R2 0.09) or EOT (0.005). Unknown.";
CM_ SG_ 1072 CrankFlag_B6 "[conf=low] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs)] b6 = 0x40 normally, 0xC0 during the one crank (sync).";
CM_ SG_ 1072 Unknown_B6_lo "[conf=low] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs)] Rest of b6, always 0x40.";
CM_ SG_ 1072 StartFlag_B7 "[conf=low] [src=2005 F-350 HS-CAN drive capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_drive_can1.log + FORScan CSV, 7E8 PCM / 7E9 TCM DIDs); 2005 F-350 HS-CAN sync capture 2026-10-25 (captures/2026-2005/2026-10-25_sync_can0.log + FORScan CSV/7E8 DIDs)] 0x0C for ~1 s right after the engine caught (sync), else 0.";
